feat(dao): Add AWS RDS IAM authentication support

From: Prasanth Baskar <bupdprasanth@gmail.com>

Add support for AWS RDS IAM authentication for PostgreSQL connections.

When PostgreSQL UseIAMAuth is enabled, the driver uses the AWS SDK to
generate an auth token for each connection attempt, removing the need
for static passwords.

New configuration keys: POSTGRESQL_USE_IAM_AUTH, POSTGRESQL_AWS_REGION.

From: Vadim Bauer <vb@8gears.com>
